  "title": "Burn Pattern",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "In the ashes of a deadly apartment fire, a single survivor’s story is the only official truth. But the facts hide a darker reality. Join journalist Ross Ford as he re-examines the case, only to find that every clue leads him deeper into a web of paranoia and supernatural dread. The key to this unsolved mystery lies in a series of disturbing audio recordings that seem to be… listening back. Burn Pattern is a four-part investigative podcast that evolves from a true crime mystery into a terrifying journey into psychological and Lovecraftian cosmic horror.",
